                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16853030" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 31 May 2019 13:44:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It seems that expectations made in the test does not conform to guarantees provided by CQ. Briefly, the test closes a CQ and after that checks that notifications were received for all successfully completed updates. But it might not be true when an async callback is used. I edited the test so a query is closed after a notifications check in the async mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16853094" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 31 May 2019 14:58:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also we should unmute tests on TC if needed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16854049" author="pavlukhin" created="Sun, 2 Jun 2019 18:29:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Run only edited on TC (see links).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16854055" author="pavlukhin" created="Sun, 2 Jun 2019 18:38:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
